{"id":"cc110e19a2eae4ea","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-primitive-recursion-operator.md","title":"Primitive Recursion Operator","display":"df-primitive-recursion-operator — Primitive Recursion Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator","aliases":["92-df-primitive-recursion-operator"],"display":"df-primitive-recursion-operator — Primitive Recursion Operator","depends_on":["[[92-df-recursion-operator]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-primitive-recursion-operator"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-primitive-recursion-operator</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-primitive-recursion-operator — Primitive Recursion Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8940b60e44b8fbd8\" href=\"?note=8940b60e44b8fbd8\" title=\"92-df-recursion-operator\">92-df-recursion-operator</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-primitive-recursion-operator-—-Primitive-Recursion-Operator-$\\mathrm{PrimRec}$\">df-primitive-recursion-operator — Primitive Recursion Operator <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> (parameter arity)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g : \\mathbb{N}^k \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(g : \\mathbb{N}^k \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (total base function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h : \\mathbb{N}^{k+2} \\to \\mathbb{N}\">\\(h : \\mathbb{N}^{k+2} \\to \\mathbb{N}\\)</span> (step function)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecOp}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{RecOp}_k\\)</span> (recursion operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8940b60e44b8fbd8\" href=\"?note=8940b60e44b8fbd8\" title=\"92-df-recursion-operator\">92-df-recursion-operator</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k\\)</span> (definition-target primitive-recursion operator)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}operator} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(g,h)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RecOp}_k(g,h):\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}operator} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(g,h)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RecOp}_k(g,h):\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g, h)\">\\(\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g, h)\\)</span> : 原始递归运算</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span>定义<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=0\">\\(m=0\\)</span>时的值</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\">\\(h\\)</span>定义<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>从<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>到<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m+1\">\\(m+1\\)</span>的递归步骤</li>\n<li>若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g, h\">\\(g, h\\)</span>原始递归，则<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>原始递归</li>\n<li>因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,h\">\\(g,h\\)</span> 总定义，部分递归算子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecOp}_k\">\\(\\mathrm{RecOp}_k\\)</span> 在这里产生总函数</li>\n<li>例：加法<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x, y) = x + y\">\\(f(x, y) = x + y\\)</span>：\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x, 0) = x\">\\(f(x, 0) = x\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g = P_1^1\">\\(g = P_1^1\\)</span>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x, y+1) = S(f(x, y))\">\\(f(x, y+1) = S(f(x, y))\\)</span>（<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(x, y, z) = S(z)\">\\(h(x, y, z) = S(z)\\)</span>）</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-primitive-recursion-operator-—-Primitive-Recursion-Operator-$\\mathrm{PrimRec}$","text":"df-primitive-recursion-operator — Primitive Recursion Operator $\\mathrm{PrimRec}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-recursion-operator","status":"resolved","id":"8940b60e44b8fbd8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursion-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursion-operator","status":"resolved","id":"8940b60e44b8fbd8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecOp}_k$ (recursion operator, see [[92-df-recursion-operator]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g : \\mathbb{N}^k \\to \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"h : \\mathbb{N}^{k+2} \\to \\mathbb{N}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecOp}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}primitive\\text{-}recursion\\text{-}operator} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PrimRec}_k(g,h)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{RecOp}_k(g,h):\\mathbb N^{k+1}\\to\\mathbb N","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PrimRec}(g, h)","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"m=0","display":false},{"tex":"h","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"m+1","displa